This project implements Regression and Classification using the UCI Garment Employee Productivity dataset.

Models
Regression: Linear Regression to predict `actual_productivity`
Classification: Logistic Regression to predict `MeetsTarget`
Both models are implemented using: Scikit-learn and NumPy & Pandas from scratch

Preprocessing
* Missing-value handling
* Categorical encoding
* Feature scaling
* Fixed train-test split for fair comparison

Evaluation
Regression:MAE, RMSE, R²
Classification:Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-score
Training and prediction time are also compared.

Optimization
The manual Logistic Regression implementation is optimized by experimenting with Learning rates and Convergence criteria

Technologies
Python • NumPy • Pandas • Scikit-learn • Jupyter Notebook
